                                             <li>Media Art Center Gallery *MAC 138<br><br>CSUB Campus Map: <a href="https://maps.csub.edu/?id=1963#!ct/57443,56863,56862?s/">California State University Bakersfield</a><br><br></li>
                                             </ul>
